  "Html": "<div><html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n<title>Rule 67:10:09:03 Hearing waiver.</title>\r\n<META NAME=\"Keywords\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:10:09:03\">\r\n<META NAME=\"Description\" Content=\"Administrative Rules 67:10:09:03 Hearing waiver.\">\r\n<meta name=Generator content=\"Microsoft Office HTML Filter 2.0\">\r\n<meta http-equiv=Content-Type content=\"text/html; charset=windows-1252\">\r\n<meta name=Originator content=\"Microsoft Word 10\">\r\n<title>CHAPTER 67:10:07</title>\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n \r\n-->\r\n</style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body lang=EN-US>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>67:10:09:03.&nbsp;&nbsp;Hearing waiver.</b> An individual accused of\r\ncommitting an IPV may waive the right to an administrative disqualification\r\nhearing for the first and second violations. An individual who waives this\r\nright is ineligible to participate in the program for one year for the first\r\nviolation and two years for the second violation. A hearing waiver may not be\r\nused for a third violation.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Source:</b> 24 SDR\r\n24, effective August 31, 1997.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>General Authority:</b>\r\nSDCL <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-7A-3\">28-7A-3(5).</A></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Law Implemented:</b>\r\nSDCL <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-7A-3\">28-7A-3(5)</A>, <A HREF=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=28-7A-16\">28-7A-16.</A></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n</div>",
